sudo (114.100.11+ds1-2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * Build-Depend on pietoolchain-host and pietoolchain-sdk.
  * The postinst records the modes of /var/db/sudo, its lectured directory
    and /var/run/sudo as dpkg statoverrides, so they can be made again where
    the package does not create them. A purge removes the records. sudo
    depends on base-files, whose /etc/group gives the records their group
    name when the postinst runs in an image build.

